      "content": "but they already checked their sugar and it's actually really high, like 350. i'm worried about the glucagon thing you mentioned though... wouldn't that make the high sugar even worse? and im not sure if they're actually low or just acting weird. can i just leave them to sleep it off for a few hours? they seem pretty out of it right now.",
