      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, you just said glucagon helps lower high blood sugar? i thought that was only for when sugar is too low? i'm so confused now. also, a hospital visit sounds like a huge deal and a lot of money, and they're already starting to drift off to sleep. if i just give them some insulin now, can't we just handle this at home and wait to see if they feel better in the morning?",
